# With no structure in x the field is a half cosine between the walls and the index follows from the exact slab index.
# Reference: analytic slab index 3.115852, lowered by the lateral half cosine to 3.114346; agreement limited by the grid.
title 340 nm silicon film, TE, between distant walls
grid dx=0.1 dy=0.01
window width=8 ymin=-1.2 ymax=1.54
layer si 0 0.34
symmetry even
field te
expect neff 3.114837477 2e-8
expect confinement 0.918531839 1e-6
expect guided no
expect cells 10960
expect neff 3.114346 1.5e-3
